      "cooked": "<p>If anyone is familiar with the Cauldron fan expansion for SotM, you might be interested in knowing that the creators of the Cauldron are now kickstarting <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/meromorphgames/norsaga/comments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">their own game</a>.</p><p>I playtested it for them and <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">w<span>rote a review of it on BGG</span></a><span><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">.</a> &nbsp;It is a fun game, very attractive and well designed.</span></p><p><span>Check it out!</span></p>",
