      "raw": "<p>If anyone is familiar with the Cauldron fan expansion for SotM, you might be interested in knowing that the creators of the Cauldron are now kickstarting <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/meromorphgames/norsaga/comments\">their own game</a>.</p><p>I playtested it for them and <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\">w<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">rote a review of it on BGG</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\">.</a> &nbsp;It is a fun game, very attractive and well designed.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Check it out!</span></p>",
