      "id": 138732,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-01T04:00:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If anyone is familiar with the Cauldron fan expansion for SotM, you might be interested in knowing that the creators of the Cauldron are now kickstarting <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/meromorphgames/norsaga/comments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">their own game</a>.I playtested it for them and <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">wrote a review of it on BGG</a><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">.</a> &nbsp;It is a fun game, very attractive and well designed.Check it out!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I talked to these guys last GenCon. They were talking with Christopher getting some feedback from him when I heard the pitch for this game. After hearing about it, seeing it in action, and getting a sweet sweet promo card, I was pretty sold on it.</p>\n<p>Glad to see it finally up on KS. You can be sure I'll be putting in a pledge at some point. Can't let my promo go to waste!</p>",
