      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nIf anyone is familiar with the Cauldron fan expansion for SotM, you might be interested in knowing that the creators of the Cauldron are now kickstarting <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/meromorphgames/norsaga/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\">their own game</a>.I playtested it for them and <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"nofollow\">wrote a review of it on BGG</a><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1317075/quick-norsaga-review\" rel=\"nofollow\">.</a> &nbsp;It is a fun game, very attractive and well designed.Check it out!\n\n[/quote]\n\nI talked to these guys last GenCon. They were talking with Christopher getting some feedback from him when I heard the pitch for this game. After hearing about it, seeing it in action, and getting a sweet sweet promo card, I was pretty sold on it.\n\nGlad to see it finally up on KS. You can be sure I&#39;ll be putting in a pledge at some point. Can&#39;t let my promo go to waste!\n",
